          caption: "An HIV result is the clearest test of the rule: it is not told to the husband in the corridor, the mother who paid for the test, the employer who sent the staff for ‘medicals’ or the ward at handover within earshot of the next bed. The patient chooses who knows and when, and the nurse's job is to help her choose well — not to choose for her.",
